1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:02,775
(Sheldon:)-I'm not accepting the award.
-Why not?

2
00:00:02,946 --> 00:00:05,986
(Howard:)Turns out the great Sheldon Cooper
has stage fright.

3
00:00:06,157 --> 00:00:07,657
(Penny:)That's no reason to back out.

4
00:00:07,825 --> 00:00:09,995
(Penny:)I once got a pretty big
honor in high school.

5
00:00:10,161 --> 00:00:12,951
(Penny:)I was terrified about appearing
in front of a big crowd...

6
00:00:13,122 --> 00:00:15,122
(Penny:)...but I went through with it.
You know?

7
00:00:15,291 --> 00:00:18,131
(Penny:)The world looked pretty darn good
sitting on a haystack...

8
00:00:18,294 --> 00:00:22,544
(Penny:)...in the back of a Ford F-150 as a
member of the corn queen's court.

9
00:00:24,884 --> 00:00:26,714
Thank you. I'll bear that in mind...

10
00:00:26,886 --> 00:00:29,636
(Sheldon:)...if I'm ever nominated
for the Hillbilly Peace Prize.

11
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:35,060
(Leonard:)-Sheldon, you're being ridiculous.
-Am I?

12
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:36,850
(Sheldon:)Let me tell you a story.

13
00:00:37,021 --> 00:00:40,191
(Howard:)Where's 70 children
when you need them?

14
00:00:40,358 --> 00:00:45,528
(Sheldon:)I was 14 and graduating
summa cum laude from college.

15
00:00:45,697 --> 00:00:48,697
"Summa cum laude" is Latin
for "with highest honors."

16
00:00:48,866 --> 00:00:52,866
(Penny:)I just love how you always skip over
the part where no one asks.

17
00:00:53,037 --> 00:00:56,037
(Sheldon:)I was valedictorian
and expected to give an address.

18
00:00:56,207 --> 00:00:58,037
(Sheldon:)Even now I can remember
that moment...

